	(footprint "Enclosure_1551WK"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "e3c32542-f1c2-483f-bee2-20c496e130ed")
		(at 77 77)
		(descr "Hammond 1551WKBK enclosure, present only so the 3D view can check the fit. No pads, no copper, no BOM entry. Deliberately carries NO smd or through_hole attribute, so KiCad's 3D viewer files it under Other and it can be switched off on its own in Preferences > Display Options without hiding any real part. The STEP is Hammond's own (files/parts/stp/1551WKBK.zip) and is Y-up with its screw side toward the board, so it carries a rotation. Origin is the centre of the in-enclosure board section.")
